# sff — Optional environment overrides
#
# You DO NOT need this file for normal use.
#   - Spotify auth is handled by sff's shared dev app + PKCE in your browser
#   - Music folder is set via the UI (Config card → Change…)
#   - Traktor sync is toggled via the UI (Config card → Sync to Traktor)
#   - Rekordbox / Traktor / ffmpeg paths are auto-detected per platform
#
# Copy this file to ".env" only if you need to override one of these defaults.
# .env is gitignored — your overrides stay local.

# ─── Spotify (advanced) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# By default sff uses a shared Client ID baked into the code. If you maintain
# your own Spotify dev app, override here:
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_own_client_id
# SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback

# ─── Path overrides (advanced) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sff auto-detects Rekordbox/Traktor/ANLZ paths per platform. Override only if
# yours live somewhere non-standard:
# MUSIC_FOLDER=/path/to/your/music/Incoming
# REKORDBOX_DB_PATH=/path/to/master.db
# TRAKTOR_NML_PATH=/path/to/collection.nml
# ANLZ_ROOT=/path/to/PIONEER/USBANLZ

# ─── Behavior ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Spotify playlists with this prefix get synced. "FF Opening" → "Opening" in Rekordbox.
# PLAYLIST_PREFIX=FF
